{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17203080","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17203080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1720308001:1":{"text":"The young man, clutching a broken sword, falls into utter despair.","source_cn":"就在年轻男人手持断剑，满眼绝望之际——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44AADFE2F21DA7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720308002:0":{"text":"At that moment, a divine figure emerges, wrapped in a soft light that doesn't seem to belong to this world. It is Dura, the ever-merciful goddess.","source_cn":"一个神圣的身影缓缓出现，她周身笼罩在柔和的光晕之中，仿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4284E7374B877262","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720308003:0":{"text":"She hears the cry of a brave mortal who refuses to give in, and she answers by placing hope in his hands.","source_cn":"仁慈的女神艾雅，听到了凡人心中不屈的呐喊。她降下神迹，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x432E03B283F95961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720308004:0":{"text":"Lift your head, brave one.","source_cn":"抬起头来，勇敢的凡人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A14309E8F870AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720308005:1":{"text":"Y-You are...?","source_cn":"您……您是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE0921ECA793285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720308006:1":{"text":"I've seen your courage. Take this sword.","source_cn":"你的勇气，我已见证。现在，我将这柄剑赐予你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2FB5224D5AC618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720308007:0":{"text":"But remember, the moment you accept it, your fate is no longer yours alone. You'll be carrying the future of all humanity on your shoulders.","source_cn":"但你要记住，从你握住它的那一刻起，你所承担的，将不再只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE048368C2270E0E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720308008:0":{"text":"Will you accept that burden?","source_cn":"你，愿意接受这份责任吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4ED34E84E9209E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720308009:0":{"text":"I... I will.","source_cn":"我……愿意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB256C32ED20D95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720308010:1":{"text":"I'll give everything I have to protect my home and end this disaster.","source_cn":"为了守护我的家园，为了终结这场灾难，我愿献出我的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA66425436D684943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720308011:1":{"text":"The moment his fingers touch the hilt, light bursts from the blade and floods the land. Dura has chosen him.","source_cn":"当他的指尖触碰到剑柄的那一刻，耀眼的光芒从剑身上迸发，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58DD56F312E3179F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720308012:1":{"text":"And with that, the hero of the Lightbearer Empire is born.","source_cn":"自此，耀光的英雄——诞生了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4339B2C05030F11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"Cassadee","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:“艾雅女神”":{"text":"\"Dura\"","source":"“艾雅女神”","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:“青年罗兰”":{"text":"\"Young Rolan\"","source":"“青年罗兰”","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}